flowchart TD
    START([state = PARSING]) --> IN

    IN{input type?}

    IN -->|CHAT message| NLP["Extract from natural language\nLook for endpoint hints GET /users\nAction verbs: fetch create delete\nResource nouns: user order product"]

    IN -->|YAML or JSON| PARSE_STRUCT["yaml.safe_load or json.loads\nExtract paths map\nExtract methods\nExtract parameters\nExtract schemas"]

